<<
/Title (The item box in Mario Kart is set up so that players toward the back of the field have a higher chance to get more valuable items. At face value, the result seems random. but the system itself is incredibly complex to determine the probability to recieve each item. Somone in first has a net vero chance to recieve a game changing item, but the person in last could get something that could near instantly propel them into the top 3.)
